onaname": "$hogun", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198887575701/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 555, "last_played": 1711853345, "avatar": "97a3f5d490cc82fe3fd70e5fac0337b79250952f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I loved this game. The story was very good and made me feel like I was a real Space Marine fighting hoards of Orks and Chaos I can't wait for the second one to come out! Multiplayer on the other hand was good other than the weapon leveling. Most online games with guns scale the guns to where it's mainly skill when fighting against other players but here the weapon damage increases once you level up, unlock them, and then able to use them. Playing against others that are already maxed level I've been one shot many times. Other than that multiplayer can still be really fun. But to sum everything up with my experience it's a very fun 40K game. Story was very good Titus is a bada** character and multiplayer is fun but could be better. Last thing $60 price tag is insane for a 2011 game so highly recommend waiting for a sale.", "timestamp_created": 1689443635, "timestamp_updated": 1689443635, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142137448", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972378368", "personaname": "Twaught Hammer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972378368/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11919, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11502, "last_played": 1689460669, "avatar": "e0c09b5544f5533c3b85ff66fcfb2f5a7c3b748e"}, "language": "english", "revie